WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.226
Patient metrics provides another unpivot example
Heart rate systolic

00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:13.339
blood pressure diastolic blood pressure and oxygen
saturation are separate wide columns The

00:00:13.366 --> 00:00:18.945
lateral VALUES block converts them into metric and
value rows This

00:00:18.958 --> 00:00:23.326
can be useful for generic plotting rule processing
or feature inspection
